{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal setup using multiprofile data with avgpool aggregation, maintaining consistent RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) encoders. Validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103 suggest multiprofile may improve performance compared to previous multimodal baselines (e.g., 0.5266 accuracy in llm_summary_001). However, the specific contribution of aggregation methods or interactions with fusion strategies remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative aggregation approaches or unimodal benchmarks."
}

